## Keypad

@narrator{code="0010"}: Four digits. The keys are worn, but not in any helpful pattern: every key is worn, as if every number had been tried.
@nell{code="0010" mono when="entry.plaque.read"}: The plaque in the lobby. The year they opened the doors.
::keypad{pad="pharmacyPad" resultKey="pad"}
<match on="scene.keypad.pad.entered">
  <when test="$ == @pharmacyCode">
    @narrator{code="0020"}: The letters go from green to white. The lock lets go with a sound like a held breath let out.
    ::assert{solved(pharmacyPad)}
  </when>
  <otherwise>
    @narrator{code="0030"}: The letters flash red, and a bell somewhere in the building starts ringing for someone to come.
    @nell{code="0020"}: No, no, no...
    ::lure{room="reception"}
    ::fright
  </otherwise>
</match>
